<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Cote de Pablo | Official Portfolio</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;700;900&display=swap');
        body { background-color: #000; color: #fff; font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; scroll-behavior: smooth; }
        .hero-title { font-size: clamp(3rem, 10vw, 8rem); line-height: 0.9; }
        .stat-box { border-left: 1px solid #27272a; padding-left: 1.5rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <nav class="fixed top-0 w-full z-50 flex justify-between items-center p-6 bg-black/80 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-zinc-800">
        <h1 class="text-sm font-bold tracking-[0.4em] uppercase">Academic Portfolio 2026</h1>
        <div class="hidden md:flex space-x-8 text-xs uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-400">
            <a href="#about" class="hover:text-white transition">Biography</a>
            <a href="#gallery" class="hover:text-white transition">Gallery</a>
            <a href="#contact" class="hover:text-white transition">Contact</a>
        </div>
        <a href="mailto:Yesitsmariacote@gmail.com" class="text-xs bg-white text-black px-5 py-2 rounded-full font-bold uppercase tracking-tighter">Get in Touch</a>
    </nav>

    <section class="relative h-screen flex items-center justify-center text-center pt-20">
        <div class="px-4">
            <p class="text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-[0.5em] text-[10px] mb-4">Final Year School Project</p>
            <h2 class="hero-title font-black mb-6 tracking-tighter uppercase">Cote de <br><span class="text-zinc-400">Pablo</span></h2>
            <div class="h-1 w-20 bg-white mx-auto mb-8"></div>
            <p class="max-w-md mx-auto text-zinc-400 text-sm uppercase tracking-widest leading-loose">Actress • Singer • Producer • Award Winner</p>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="about" class="py-32 px-6 border-t border-zinc-900">
        <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
            <h3 class="text-xs font-bold text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-[0.4em] mb-16 text-center">Comprehensive Profile</h3>
            
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 mb-24">
                <div class="stat-box">
                    <p class="text-[10px] uppercase text-zinc-500 tracking-widest mb-2">Born</p>
                    <p class="text-xl font-light">Nov 12, 1979</p>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-box">
                    <p class="text-[10px] uppercase text-zinc-500 tracking-widest mb-2">Age</p>
                    <p class="text-xl font-light">46 Years</p>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-box">
                    <p class="text-[10px] uppercase text-zinc-500 tracking-widest mb-2">Birthplace</p>
                    <p class="text-xl font-light">Santiago, Chile</p>
                </div>
                <div class="stat-box">
                    <p class="text-[10px] uppercase text-zinc-500 tracking-widest mb-2">Education</p>
                    <p class="text-xl font-light">Carnegie Mellon</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-start">
                <div class="space-y-8">
                    <h4 class="text-4xl font-bold italic tracking-tighter uppercase">The Journey of an Icon</h4>
                    <p class="text-xl font-light leading-relaxed text-zinc-300">
                        Maria José de Pablo Fernández, known professionally as <strong>Cote de Pablo</strong>, is a Chilean-American actress and singer.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-zinc-400 leading-relaxed text-sm">
                        Born in Santiago, Chile, she moved to Miami at age 10. She studied music theater at Carnegie Mellon University before hosting the show <em>Control</em>. In 2005, she achieved global stardom as Ziva David on the CBS series NCIS. Her career has been marked by versatility, from intense action roles to professional vocal performances on the NCIS soundtrack.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="group">
                    <div class="aspect-[4/5] rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-zinc-800 shadow-2xl">
                        <img src="profile.jpg" alt="Cote de Pablo Portrait" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
                    </div>
                    <p class="mt-4 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-600 text-center">Portrait: Official Series</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <section id="gallery" class="bg-zinc-950 py-32 px-6 border-t border-zinc-900">
        <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
            <h3 class="text-3xl font-bold uppercase tracking-tighter mb-12">Cinematic Legacy</h3>
            <div class="group inline-block w-full">
                <div class="aspect-video bg-zinc-900 rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-zinc-800 transition-all duration-500">
                    <img src="profile.jpg" alt="Cote de Pablo Official" class="w-full h-full object-cover">
                </div>
                <p class="mt-6 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-zinc-600">Featured Gallery Selection</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <footer id="contact" class="py-40 text-center border-t border-zinc-900 bg-black">
        <div class="px-6">
            <h3 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-black mb-12 italic tracking-tighter text-white uppercase">Contact</h3>
            <p class="text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-widest text-xs mb-6">Professional Inquiries & Collaborations</p>
            <a href="mailto:Yesitsmariacote@gmail.com" class="inline-block group">
                <span class="text-xl md:text-4xl font-light text-white underline underline-offset-[12px] decoration-zinc-800">
                    Yesitsmariacote@gmail.com
                </span>
            </a>
            <div class="mt-32 pt-8 border-t border-zinc-900">
                <p class="text-[10px] text-zinc-700 uppercase tracking-[0.5em]">© 2026 Frank Zander | Academic Research Project</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
